        "id": 1594463
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-17T05:23:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Are we planning on putting all Cronet tests inside CronetApiTest, or should this be renamed to CronetUrlRequestTest? My suggestion would be to split tests up into smaller classes. We can move generally useful or common code to frameworks/libs/net/common/testutils.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 50,
        "startChar": 13,
        "endLine": 50,
        "endChar": 26
      },
      "revId": "7e25df56915793d228665ecd5f50089f5d83ab1e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
