      "writtenOn": "2022-11-17T05:23:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am not a big fan of this. This makes the test pretty hard to read. Let\u0027s find a way to make VerifyUrlRequestCallback more useful.\n\nI think VerifyUrlRequestCallback should be changed to use ArrayTrackRecord, see [EthernetStateListener](https://source.corp.google.com/aosp-master/packages/modules/Connectivity/tests/cts/net/src/android/net/cts/EthernetManagerTest.kt;l\u003d198), or [TestableNetworkCallback](https://source.corp.google.com/aosp-master/frameworks/libs/net/common/testutils/devicetests/com/android/testutils/TestableNetworkCallback.kt) for example.\n\nThis will allow the tests to look somewhat like:\n```\nfinal VerifyUrlRequestCallback cb \u003d new VerifyUrlRequestCallback();\nfinal UrlRequest request \u003d mCronetEngine.newUrlRequestBuilder(...).build();\nrequest.start();\ncb.expectCallbackA();\ncb.expectCallbackB();\ncb.expectOnSucceeded();\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 106,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 119,
        "endChar": 8
      },
      "revId": "7e25df56915793d228665ecd5f50089f5d83ab1e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
